  "behavior": [
    "Actual Core compound commit follows verified logical Participant membership across a distinct configured SIP account. Exact stream/connection selectors retain physical owner checks; per-packet current authorization remains mandatory.",
    "Schema61 retains one exact begun commit and immutable known/unknown captures. Projection creates the actual SIP connection and standalone telephone lifetime, retires only the original source, and updates exact audience revisions atomically. Store tests cover once-only phases, wrong captures, late known metadata, rollback, independent authority and exact absence cleanup.",
    "Both actual answered PCMU/PCMA public flows refuse early/output-only and wrong/retransmitted confirmation, quarantine decoded private input, then require attributed 55# and real private duplex before generation2 movement. Eight effects confirm at attempt1; replay emits no new INVITE.",
    "Actual telephone/native programme works both directions after commit, after old source and controller credential revocation plus late cancel/replay, and after the original preparation expires. Own route credential revocation yields actual BYE, candidate absence and one durable retirement while the retained native connection and completed root remain.",
    "Host scene snapshots copy bounded metadata under the short registry lock before Store/Core admission. Temporary packet lookup or SQL contention cannot be treated as authority loss; adoption retries only metadata."
  ],
  "preliminary_failures": [
    "The first movement pair exposed immediate post-commit SQL contention being treated as target authority loss. Adoption now retries metadata only.",
    "Subsequent parallel PCMU cases exposed the host scene registry try_lock reporting temporary packet lookup contention as forbidden. The source watcher cancelled the preparation; detailed SIP logs confirmed actual BYE and distinct RTP ports. Host snapshots now use the short registry lock. Final all-six parallel telephone suite passes."
  ],
